title: ignoredVan
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The woman shoves the man into the back seat of her van and drives off.][/nomarkup] #line:05aa9ea
{$kieran}: That was certainly… weird?
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You see that Kieran looks confused. You want to believe that everything will be fine for this guy, but you're not so sure about it as you see the van driving away.][/nomarkup]
<<FailObjective "Q_0P_NEVER_TRUST_WHITE_VAN" "O_0P_WHITE_VAN_HELP_THE_MAN">>
-> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
