title: approachKiddnaper
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][As the soccer mom notices you approaching, her face glowers for a second before beaming a smile.][/nomarkup] #line:030ec26
<<if GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Wits", "Insight") >= 4>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][It's obviously insincere.][/nomarkup] #line:0e50a44
    <<set $smileInsincere to 1>>
<<endif>>
Soccer Mom: Can I help you? #line:07039b0
-> {$pcName}: Nevermind #line:0ebf603
    Soccer Mom: ... Alright then. #line:02eb218
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The man mouths, “Help me.”][/nomarkup] #line:0e43181
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Suspicious, she looks over her shoulder the rest of her trek to her van.][/nomarkup] #line:011eb50
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The man plummets to the ground as she loosens her grip and draws her gun. Two men donned in all black emerge from her van.][/nomarkup] #line:0b4d86b
    Soccer Mom: Get'em boys!  #line:0017b0e
    -> [nomarkup][Draw your weapon.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: Is he alright? (Wits + Awarness) #line:0d92186
    <<if Roll("Wits","Awarness")>=2-$smileInsincere>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She's jumpy and sweating bullets. Looking her over, you spy the shimmer of the gun she is holding to the man's side.][/nomarkup] #success #line:0b3b1fb
    <<else>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You try to discern what the problem could be, but find yourself distracted by her horrible fashion choices.][/nomarkup] #failure #line:0a45fe8
    <<endif>>
    Soccer Mom: He's fine, why do you ask? #line:0732979
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The man mouths, “Help me.”][/nomarkup] #line:0594efd
    {$kieran}: He doesn't look “fine.” #line:03cfabe
    Soccer Mom: [nomarkup][Laughing anxiously][/nomarkup] He just had a little too much to drink. #line:00eac00
    Soccer Mom: ... #line:0f1f735
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The tension in the air brought on by the stand-off is palpable. She knows the jig is up.][/nomarkup] #line:0854555
    Soccer Mom: Ah, fuck it! #line:0e39fbc
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The man plummets to the ground as she loosens her grip and draws her gun. Two men donned in all black emerge from her van.][/nomarkup]
